      "doc_id": "kb_1c52a3a8",
      "text": "0.3\n0.7Ⅱ\n1.0Ⅲ\n1.4150 V DC\ncl\n—\n1.5\n0.03\n0.251.5\n0.3cr\nⅠ\n0.3\n0.8Ⅱ\n1.1Ⅲ\n1.6300 V DC\ncl\n—\n3.0\n3.0\n0.7\n0.03\n0.5cr\nⅠ\n0.7\n1.5Ⅱ\n2.1Ⅲ\n3.0600 V DC\ncl\n—\n5.5\n5.5\n1.7\n0.06\n0.7cr\nⅠ\n1.7\n3.04.3Ⅱ Ⅲ\n6.01 000 V DC\ncl\n—",
      "title": "GB+47739-2026",
